OL,3,AThese firms you've never heard of are
OL,4,Afeeding fears the AI bubble could burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FA once-obscure corner of the AI
OL,7,Fecosystem finds itself in the spotlight
OL,8,F` and investors don't all like what
OL,9,Fthey see.
OL,11,FNames like CoreWeave and Nebius are
OL,12,Ffamiliar to the tech set in San
OL,13,FFrancisco and Silicon Valley.
OL,15,FThese data centre companies, known as
OL,16,Fneocloud firms, run large warehouses
OL,17,Fpacked with expensive computers, which
OL,18,Fthey lease to major AI developers like
OL,19,FAnthropic, OpenAI and Meta.
OL,21,FThey're now the subject of one of
OL,22,FSilicon Valley's most heated debates.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
