OL,3,AWho are the real winners of Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from The Celebrity Traitors
OL,8,Ffinal
OL,10,FIn some ways, all the players on The
OL,11,FCelebrity Traitors can be seen as
OL,12,Fwinners.
OL,14,FThey all got to appear on a hugely
OL,15,Fpopular TV show, rubbing shoulders with
OL,16,Fother stars and gaining new fans along
OL,17,Fthe way.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
